spconv-wheels
Build scripts and CI for producing CUDA 12.8 / 13.0 wheels of upstream projects:

- spconv (https://github.com/traveller59/spconv), Copyright Yan Yan and
  contributors, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
- cumm (https://github.com/FindDefinition/cumm), Copyright Yan Yan and
  contributors, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

The released wheels are built from unmodified upstream sources at the tags
named in build.sh, except for two build-level changes applied by build.sh:
spconv's setup.py cumm upper bound is lifted from <0.8.0 to <0.9.0, and for
the CUDA 13.0 flavor cumm's setup.py C++ standard is raised from c++14 to
c++17 (required by nvcc 13).

This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by the upstream projects.
